==Finnish==

===Etymology===
*A passive verb, derived from the verb ''[[syödä]]''.

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: syö·py·ä
*Rhymes: [[yöpyä]]

===Verb===
{{fi-verb|syö|type=häipyä}}

# {{intransitive|+ illative}} To [[eat]] into, [[erode]] (''soil''), [[corrode]] (''metal'').

====Idioms====
*''syöpyä'' + ''genitive'' + [[mieli|mieleen]] = to [[be]] ([[indelible|indelibly]]) [[engrave]]d/[[inscribe]]d on sb's [[mind]]/[[memory]].

====Derived terms====
*verbs: ''causative'' [[syövyttää]]

